## 17:00–18:25 — Laya yoga: the outer fire becomes inner dissolution

### Writer instruction

Use laya only as a comparative interpretive model.

Core sequence:

* gross identity;
* sensory impressions;
* elements;
* mental categories;
* individuality;
* absorption into a subtler principle.

The cremation ground externally displays decomposition. Laya yoga internally models the dissolution of constructed layers.

This is a structural analogy—not proof that cremation-ground rites were originally invented as laya-yoga exercises.

