# Claims to avoid

1. Aghoris are simply surviving Kāpālikas.
2. Cremation-ground rites were common to all Tantra.
3. Human remains automatically imply human sacrifice.
4. Abhinavagupta encouraged uninitiated social transgression.
5. Mortality-salience research proves tantric metaphysics.
6. Fear exposure always reduces fear.
7. The cremation ground was only symbolic.
8. Modern ghat workers are tantric practitioners.

